{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed single-button platformer where precise timing is key. Switch gravity through twisted levels that will put your reflexes to the test.  Includes single player story mode and competitive local multiplayer for <strong>up to 8 players</strong>. Easily create and publish your own levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/extras/4dddcb80770228b10dff6a650bbe1e9b.poster.avif?t=1761665537\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/extras/4dddcb80770228b10dff6a650bbe1e9b.webm?t=1761665537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/extras/4dddcb80770228b10dff6a650bbe1e9b.mp4?t=1761665537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging single-player <strong>story mode</strong> with 8 levels\u00a0\u2014 discover the secrets of the simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive local multiplayer mode for up to <strong>8 players</strong>\u00a0\u2014 lots of chaotic fun for everyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and share your own levels in the intuitive <strong>level editor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thousands</strong> of single-player and multiplayer user levels to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full gamepad, keyboard and mouse</strong> support\u00a0\u2014 mix and match in multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless profile creation with Steam login (option to link to an existing G-Switch account is available)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works great on the Steam Deck (awaiting Steam Deck V